  I don't think a single curse attack can take a single item from
blessed to cursed.  Your BoH was almost certainly just "uncursed" before
the malignant aura struck.  

  After every curse attack you should check your BoH, wielded weapon(s)
and worn shield (if any) and dip in holy water as necessary to keep them
blessed.  Unihorns and luckstones should be checked and uncursed if they
become cursed.   

  I.e. BoH, wielded weapons and worn shields should be kept blessed.
Unihorns and luckstones should not be carried in a "cursed" state.

